('s_65b231b0870ca5.54219588', 'Калькулятор озвучивания сломался', '01KNHVWYBVJT0X6QN30HJ4VDVJ', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A59GT3S93MKB77K9N1AQSF1AP1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Опять отвалился доступ к АПИ, из-за отстутсвия  HTTPS.

## Решение (временное):
Разместили шлюз на субдомене - https://ars_ac_gateway.teftele.com/api/service/getpattern/ - он пересылает запрос с на арстеловский сервер без HTTPS.

**После этого словили ошибку:**
&gt; ac.php:1 Access to fetch at &#039;https://ars_ac_gateway.teftele.com/api/service/getpattern/&#039; from origin &#039;https://arstel.com&#039; has been blocked by CORS policy: Response to preflight request doesn&#039;t pass access control check: No &#039;Access-Control-Allow-Origin&#039; header is present on the requested resource. If an opaque response serves your needs, set the request&#039;s mode to &#039;no-cors&#039; to fetch the resource with CORS disabled.

Решение в хедерах:

``` js
&lt;?php 
header(&#039;Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *&#039;);
header(&quot;Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Content-Type&quot;);
function readUrlReceived() 
{
    $handle = fopen(&#039;php://input&#039;, &#039;r&#039;);
    $params = &#039;&#039;;
    while ($chunk = fread($handle, 1024)){
        $params .= $chunk;
    }
    return $params;
}
$params = readUrlReceived();
$params = json_decode($params);
// The data to send to the API
$postData = array(
    &#039;id&#039; =&gt; $params-&gt;id
);
// Setup cURL
$ch = curl_init(&#039;http://spl.arstel.com/api/service/getpattern&#039;);
curl_setopt_array($ch, array(
    CURLOPT_POST =&gt; TRUE,
    CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER =&gt; TRUE,
    CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER =&gt; array(
        &#039;Content-Type: application/json&#039;
    ),
    CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS =&gt; json_encode($postData)
));
// Send the request
$response = curl_exec($ch);
// Check for errors
if($response === FALSE){
    die(curl_error($ch));
}
// Close the cURL handler
curl_close($ch);
header(&#039;Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8&#039;);
// header(&#039;Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate&#039;);
// header(&#039;Expires: Mon, 26 Jul 1997 05:00:00 GMT&#039;);
// Print the date from the response
echo $response;
```', 1, 1, 1, 2, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2024-01-25 00:00:00', '2024-01-25 11:46:10', '2024-01-25 10:02:24'),
