&lt;li index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;If you have a recursive function that calls itself without a proper base case or termination condition, it can lead to infinite recursion. Ensure that your code does not unintentionally keep calling &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;code&gt;$zip-&amp;gt;open()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; without a stopping condition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
