&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use Debugging Statements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;marker:text-textOff list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Add debugging statements before and after your calls to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;code&gt;$zip-&amp;gt;open()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; to track how many times it’s being called and under what conditions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review Stack Trace&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;marker:text-textOff list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;If you have access to error logs or can enable error reporting in PHP, look at the stack trace when the script runs out of stack space. This will help identify where the recursion is happening.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test with Minimal Code&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;marker:text-textOff list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Isolate the problem by creating a minimal script that only attempts to open a zip file and add a single file. This can help determine if the issue lies in your broader application logic or specifically with how you&#039;re using &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;code&gt;ZipArchive&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;mb-2 mt-6 text-lg first:mt-3&quot;&gt;Conclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;span&gt;By following these guidelines and checking for common pitfalls related to recursion and error handling in your use of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;code&gt;ZipArchive&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;, you should be able to resolve the infinite recursive call issue. If problems persist, please provide more details about how you are calling &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;code&gt;$zip-&amp;gt;open()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; and any surrounding logic that might contribute to this behavior.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

