 class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div color=&quot;super&quot; class=&quot;flex items-center space-x-sm&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;default font-display text-lg font-medium text-textMain dark:text-textMainDark selection:bg-super/50 selection:text-textMain dark:selection:bg-superDuper/10 dark:selection:text-superDark&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative -top-[1px] flex w-[24px] transform-gpu items-center justify-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-textMain dark:text-textMainDark flex aspect-[60/74] items-center justify-start overflow-hidden&quot; style=&quot;height: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg width=&quot;60&quot; height=&quot;74&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 60 74&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; class=&quot;h-full w-auto shrink-0 transform-gpu&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M29.6848 25.4603L48.3092 41.4828V65.1065L29.6848 49.0293M29.6848 25.4603L10.5359 40.7925L10.5892 64.669L29.6316 49.0293M29.6848 25.4603L3.4071 24.8588V48.5542L10.0911 48.6959M29.6848 25.4603L55.9884 25.7611V49.5761L48.6649 49.4467M29.6848 25.4603L11.3722 9.03792L11.2884 24.5988M29.6848 25.4603L48.7956 9.74877V25.4474M29.6848 25.4603L29.63 2.75943M29.6848 25.4603V49.1113M29.63 71.6481L29.6848 49.0839&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;4.7&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;default font-display text-lg font-medium text-textMain dark:text-textMainDark selection:bg-super/50 selection:text-textMain dark:selection:bg-superDuper/10 dark:selection:text-superDark&quot;&gt;Answer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;mb-md&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative default font-sans text-base text-textMain dark:text-textMainDark selection:bg-super/50 selection:text-textMain dark:selection:bg-superDuper/10 dark:selection:text-superDark&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;min-w-0 break-words [word-break:break-word]&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;prose dark:prose-invert inline leading-normal break-words min-w-0 [word-break:break-word]&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Creating an API in C++ that acts as a daemon to handle HTTP requests, process JSON data, and manage files is a feasible approach. Below is a structured guide on how to implement such an API using C++ on Linux.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;mb-2 mt-6 text-lg first:mt-3&quot;&gt;Overview of the Implementation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;marker:text-textOff list-decimal pl-8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HTTP Server&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;: You can use a lightweight HTTP server library in C++ to handle incoming requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JSON Handling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;: Use a JSON library to parse incoming JSON requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;File Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;: Implement functions to save files to the specified directory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daemonization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;: Run the application as a daemon to listen for requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
